AI Incident Atlas
=================

Incident data: AI Incident Database (AIID), Responsible AI Collaborative —
https://incidentdatabase.ai — licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.
Snapshot used: backup-20261102100724.tar.bz2 (2026-11-02), see data/SOURCES.md.

Expert taxonomies used for evaluation (shipped in the AIID snapshot, CC BY-SA 4.0):
- MIT AI Risk Repository domain taxonomy classifications
- Goals, Methods and Failures (GMF) taxonomy
- CSET AI Harm Taxonomy for AIID (CSETv1)

Report contents (news articles) are subject to their publishers' rights. This
project shows only short attributed excerpts with links to the originals.

Sentence embeddings: sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (Apache-2.0).
